    "question": "Harper has 15 rubber bands. His brother has 6 fewer rubber bands than he has. How many rubber bands do they have together?",
    "gold": "24",
    "answer": "His brother has 15 rubber bands - 6 rubber bands = <<15-6=9>>9 rubber bands.\nThey have 15 rubber bands + 9 rubber bands = <<15+9=24>>24 rubber bands together.\n#### 24"
